[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":310},["ShallowReactive",2],{"_M74j0BMx8grtGvsScDAyuU7BavzGjQRhNnc006wMkY":3},{"seo":4,"slug":8,"isDarkTheme":9,"heroBackgroundColour":10,"highlightColour":12,"simpleTitle":14,"excerpt":15,"hero":16,"heroAsset":30,"location":45,"sector":46,"services":53,"introCopy":54,"storyblockAccordions":55,"storyblockAssets":65,"flexibleContent":90,"footerLinkLabel":302,"footerLinks":303},{"title":5,"description":6,"image":7},"Bounce","Shed reimagines the design for Bounce at Battersea Power Station, relaunching the social gaming pioneer to reclaim its place as an industry hospitality leader ",null,"bounce",false,{"hex":11},"#4FBA86",{"hex":13},"#FFFFFF","Bounce Battersea","Staying ahead of the game by playing to sporting origins.",{"title":17,"subtitle":18},"\u003Cp>Bounce\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Battersea\u003C/p>",{"value":19,"links":29},{"schema":20,"document":21},"dast",{"type":22,"children":23},"root",[24],{"type":25,"children":26},"paragraph",[27],{"type":28,"value":15},"span",[],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":31,"videoUrl":32,"videoWidth":33,"image":34},900,"",1600,{"width":35,"height":36,"url":37,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":38},3423,2281,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727100997-krishumphreysphotography-c-44.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":39,"srcSet":40,"src":41,"width":42,"height":43,"sizes":44},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727100997-krishumphreysphotography-c-44.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727100997-krishumphreysphotography-c-44.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727100997-krishumphreysphotography-c-44.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727100997-krishumphreysphotography-c-44.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727100997-krishumphreysphotography-c-44.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727100997-krishumphreysphotography-c-44.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727100997-krishumphreysphotography-c-44.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727100997-krishumphreysphotography-c-44.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727100997-krishumphreysphotography-c-44.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200",3200,2132,"(max-width: 3200px) 100vw, 3200px","Battersea Power Station, London",[47,50],{"slug":48,"label":49},"hospitality","Hospitality",{"slug":51,"label":52},"competitive-gaming","Social  Gaming","Interior Design","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>When the original trailblazers of social gaming came to Shed for their first new project in over 10 years, we knew it was all about navigating an evolving market. With a site waiting in the iconic Battersea Power Station, the game was set for a seminal brand relaunch, re-establishing Bounce as the industry leaders once more. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[56,59,62],{"title":57,"copy":58},"The Challenge","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>As a once emerging market matured around them, Bounce found themselves in a sea of imitators. The brief was simple: stand out from the crowd by establishing their position as the premium social gaming destination. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":60,"copy":61},"The Strategy","\u003Cdiv>\n\u003Cdiv>\u003Cspan>Own your origins. A simple, bold play between the quirky joy of ping pong and premium hospitality cues, all within the brutalist architecture of the historic Battersea Power Station.\u2028\u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>",{"title":63,"copy":64},"The Solution","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>A clean and fresh aesthetic that still has all the buzzy feels of a night out. The industrial quirks of the Power Station&rsquo;s legacy live on, in this playful, abstract ping pong world. By staying true to Bounce&rsquo;s sporting origins, the result is not only authentic, but instantly recognisable, within the market. Imitators stand down&hellip;. Game, set match.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Credits: Artwork by Black Rabbit. Video Content by Bounce.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[66,78,87],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":31,"videoUrl":32,"videoWidth":33,"image":67},{"width":68,"height":69,"url":70,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":71},3424,2283,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727101726-krishumphreysphotography-c-2.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":72,"srcSet":73,"src":74,"width":75,"height":76,"sizes":77},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727101726-krishumphreysphotography-c-2.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727101726-krishumphreysphotography-c-2.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727101726-krishumphreysphotography-c-2.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727101726-krishumphreysphotography-c-2.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 2094w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727101726-krishumphreysphotography-c-2.jpg?dpr=1.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 3141w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727101726-krishumphreysphotography-c-2.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727101726-krishumphreysphotography-c-2.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727101726-krishumphreysphotography-c-2.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727101726-krishumphreysphotography-c-2.jpg?fit=crop&w=2094 2094w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727101726-krishumphreysphotography-c-2.jpg?dpr=1.5&fit=crop&w=2094 3141w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727101726-krishumphreysphotography-c-2.jpg?fit=crop&w=2094",2094,1396,"(max-width: 2094px) 100vw, 2094px",{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":31,"videoUrl":32,"videoWidth":33,"image":79},{"width":80,"height":81,"url":82,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":83},5561,3707,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1727101764-krishumphreysphotography-c-91.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":84,"srcSet":